  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "台灣人寫真 - 做生日"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "\n<div class=\"tg-article\" style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft JhengHei', sans-serif; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.8; color: #333;\">\n    <h1 style=\"color: #000; font-size: 36px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 5px; font-weight: bold;\">做生日</h1>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n        <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 20px; margin: 0;\">/ 鄭玉鳳</p>\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-images\">\n        <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgeDIX9bH56eJovVKo4rmOp86qtfYg_iUdlVgWJ_vhZfGPEq3Y8LCzO87NH5h4wM9LZ_aikIw_9bmOitB6yIl4dW9uL5KXtWtLq8t61RB0iFfATGYpArR9SkIccPCda5Z3FUdHohl8uFE-XMGe-RCurRWbWY-WOFCouurq4JyMXSlMEWPFQJpLywlFm3aql\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 4px;\"></div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-content\" style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-bottom: 30px; text-align: justify; padding: 0 10px;\">\n        小學三年ê歇寒，lán人正月12。厚雨水ê宜蘭平洋，仝款koh leh chha̍p-chha̍p滴。囡仔人pìnn無路來，規陣kheh踮大廳chhia龜弄甕，親像leh滾地龍án-ne。M̄-nā吵著神明公媽，連規間ê厝瓦mā kiōng-beh kā掀--起-來。<br><br>Sńg kah tng熱ê時，阿母雄雄徛tī窗仔跤，目睭掠我金金siòng，koh hiàm我去寮仔底等--伊。隨hō͘我心肝chhia̍k--一-下，mā知影liam-mi皮tio̍h-ài繃hō͘ ân。閒頭時阿母án-ne叫，若m̄是tàu做khang-khòe，啊無，就是kā我tia̍p一頓粗飽。見若sńg kah tng暢ê時chūn，伊就來叫東叫西，顛倒小弟lóng m̄揣，刁工掠阮拄siàu，不時to leh舞chit款àu戲，真正chih載bē tiâu。<br><br>阮鼻仔摸--leh，無kài情願淺拖仔long--leh，行入去寮仔thèng候阮母--à。<br><br>無偌久，阿母穿雨moa戴le̍h仔輕跤細手，ùi後壁溝se̍h--入-來。有lio̍h仔tám-tám，越頭beh thèng候伊ê審判，料bē到阿母soah uì雨moa ê內lak仔jîm兩粒sa̍h好ê雞卵kah一chhok用日誌紙包ê幼鹽，叫我khû--落，peh卵hō͘我食。伊講：「今仔你生日，sa̍h兩粒卵kā你做生日。」Koh hoan咐講：「Liam-mi食了，mài去kā lín小弟小妹展，知--無？」<br><br>我leh食卵ê時，有siam著阿母leh chhńg tiâu tī卵殼內底一屑屑仔ê卵白。我tu一粒卵beh pun hō͘阿母食，koh叫伊mài chhńg--ah。伊講：「生日ài食兩粒，你做你食。」<br><br>就án-ne，兩母仔囝khû tī寮仔底，恬恬食卵做生日。<br><br>40冬後，正月12，仝hit个落雨ê下晡，我khû tī tâm溼溼ê塗跤，看ǹg曠闊ê稻埕，老母滴水ê瓜le̍h仔kah塗色ê雨moa、sa̍h好iáu燒hut-hut ê雞卵、恬chiuh-chiuh ê寮仔底，lóng明明明tiâu tī我ê頭殼內，án-ne ê生日，一世人做一擺就有夠--ah！\n    </div>\n\n    \n\n    <div class=\"donation-section\" style=\"background-color: #fcfcfc; border: 1px solid #eeeeee; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; margin-top: 40px;\">\n        <div style=\"width: 100%;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEg-AcDPaO29nBtpX-fusYc5WRSX4T4j2RFh_Cv13C47q5n9E4O3kS0DRor4JBtqVHIe6qiJJXveaG6dXwSUSimgsbzS7iChemdGhHaJy6LLxfRBjX7dil-iImPkml0R0GSm_0Ive3_V1t9t6eWGC_59AGGaQzLWQO3d7uvLZYeKKwF_9RpLCnH-jC0QET5r\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"padding: 30px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 22px;\">\n                <b><span style=\"color: #3778cd;\">#台文通訊BONG報</span> 385期，2026年04月出刊。</b>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會</div>\n            <div style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 16px;\">\n                線上捐款(定期定額) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a><br>\n                線上捐款(單筆) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 15px; line-height: 1.5;\">\n                郵政劃撥：19021486 / 戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會<br>\n                電匯：123-20-050514-2 (華南銀行士林分行)\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #050505; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 25px; padding-top: 15px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; text-align: justify;\">\n                #李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>"
